    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t02-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t02-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26国考）甲、乙两车间每天可加工2000个零件。若甲、乙车间效率分别提升10%和20%，则两车间每天可加工2260个零件。问效率提升前甲车间每天可加工多少个零件？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1100"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1200"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1300"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1400"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          23
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          17
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s02-t02-mother-01-p023.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（二） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第17页",
            "pdfPage": 23
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t02-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t02-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先求整体效率增幅：(2260-2000)/2000=13%。甲增长10%、乙增长20%，整体13%是按提升前产量加权的平均增长率。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "甲原产量:乙原产量=(20-13):(13-10)=7:3"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "甲原来每天加工2000×7/10=1400个，选D。核验甲提升后1540、乙提升后720，合计2260。别拿提升后的产量去当交叉比例的权重。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "混合增长率的十字交叉，权重是增长前的基期量。"
        }
      ],
