    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t02-practice-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t02-practice-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把原80%的盐水设为100克，其中盐80克。加水后为32%，所以总质量80/32%=250克，加水150克。随后加入8%的盐水，和现有32%盐水混成28%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "现有32\\%盐水:加入8\\%盐水=(28-8):(32-28)=5:1"
